          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making ranged attacks, while the target is within 12" of the unit, improve the unit's Strength characteristic by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="cefa-d670-9541-e319" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="10ef-e7be-a002-07b6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
