      <profiles>
        <profile name="Repulsor" id="ab11-ba1a-943b-7d2b" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">16</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">100mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="fba3-8a5e-77c9-40c0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="4c71-67e2-1114-fbdd" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Combat Embarkation" id="fd47-d020-ce2d-9e09" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After an enemy unit selects targets for its charge but before it makes a Charge move, you may use this ability, during the Charge phase, in the opponent's turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit that is unengaged if the triggering unit has selected the selected unit as a target and the selected unit is able to embark within this unit and every model in the selected unit is within 3" of the unit:
    -&gt; That unit is eligible to embark into this unit.
    -&gt; The triggering unit can select new targets for that charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
