      <profiles>
        <profile name="Death Company Dreadnought" id="c59e-972f-e8c6-419b" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">90mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Black Rage" id="e630-c20f-790c-5ad2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 with melee weapons.
While the unit is not within 6" of a friendly BLOOD ANGELS CHARACTER unit or while the unit is not within 12" of a friendly CHAPLAIN unit, the unit cannot Fall Back.
While the unit is not within 6" of a friendly BLOOD ANGELS CHARACTER unit or while the unit is not within 12" of a friendly CHAPLAIN unit, set the unit's Objective Control characteristic to 0.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Driven by Fury" id="89ea-a8cf-a973-2fcb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After an enemy unit shoots, during the Shooting phase, in the opponent's turn, if the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence, the triggering unit can make a Surge move of up to D6+1".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="7985-0d2a-50a9-526a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="e7ba-58e9-6657-3ac8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="15dd-49d5-6534-f6d3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
