        </profile>
        <profile name="Mass of Doom" id="1539-d9ae-888d-1eaa" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If the unit charged this turn, against a unit that is not a MONSTER or VEHICLE, melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [DEVASTATING WOUNDS].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Redeemer of the Lost" id="68d7-ac3b-f440-0eeb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During the Fight phase, while this model is leading a unit, each time a model in the unit is destroyed, it can fight before being removed from play.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="11b1-c4c5-aa1d-6fbc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
