          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Icon of Old Caliban (Aura)" id="e2d4-7c63-e960-7b92" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly DARK ANGELS unit is within 6" of this unit, that unit gains the Stealth ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="6244-5259-6c2a-ba32" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="0fe3-c50f-854f-f0ef" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lone Operative" id="ee27-7974-115a-8634" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Enemy units cannot target this model with ranged weapons unless the attacking unit is within 12".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
