            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">11</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">92x120mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Storm of Vengeance" id="32fa-3906-0008-b012" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After an enemy unit shoots, you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in the opponent's turn, if the triggering unit has destroyed 1+ friendly DARK ANGELS units with its just-resolved attacks within 6" of the unit, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; While making normal shooting attacks, the unit is eligible to shoot.
  -&gt; While making normal shooting attacks, the unit must target the triggering unit with ranged attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="9870-fcaa-8558-68ae" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="63cd-1226-3f6c-6583" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
