      <profiles>
        <profile name="Inner Circle" id="a4d8-a56f-8f48-ed30" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Subtract 1 from the unit's Damage characteristic.
The unit cannot be targeted with the Tactical Dreadnought Fortitude Terminator Storm Force Stratagem.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="4274-03ae-751b-7237" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Teleport Homer" id="592d-f628-1ee5-a1b8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; At the start of the battle, you may use this ability: place a teleport homer token marker.
-&gt; When you target the unit with the Rapid Ingress Stratagem, you may use this ability, when resolving this use:
  -&gt; Reduce the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1CP (to a minimum of 0CP).
  -&gt; The unit must be set up on the battlefield within 3" of a teleport homer token marker more than 8" away from all enemy models.
  -&gt; Remove that teleport homer token marker from the battlefield.
-&gt; Each time an enemy unit ends a move: while the triggering unit is within 1" of a teleport homer token marker, remove that teleport homer token marker from the battlefield.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
