        <profile name="Leader" id="0945-b88f-c51e-9b69" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Strategic Knowledge" id="3ab3-cf27-2df9-7372" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT].
-&gt; When the unit is selected to make an Advance move: the unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Advanced this turn.
-&gt; When the unit is selected to make a Fall Back move:
  -&gt; The unit is eligible to shoot even if it Fell Back this turn.
  -&gt; The unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Fell Back this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Purgatus Quarry" id="5d84-9e0f-bcee-6292" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; At the start of the battle round, if during the first battle round, you can:
  -&gt; Select up to one enemy unit, binding it as hunted selection (your Hunted target). When your Hunted target is destroyed, you may select up to one enemy unit, binding it as hunted selection to replace it. Only one such designation can be active for this bearer unit. For the rest of the battle, each time a model in this unit makes an attack against it, while the unit is tagged hunted, you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Watch Master" id="cb11-4ed9-b264-e6af" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Against CHARACTER targets:
  -&gt; You can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 for attacks made by this model.
  -&gt; You can re-roll a Wound roll of 1 for attacks made by this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
