        <profile name="Sentinel Protocols" id="9362-b1a1-b3a6-4052" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: The unit is eligible to be targeted with the Fire Overwatch Stratagem even if it has already been targeted with that Stratagem this phase.
While making snap shooting attacks:
  -&gt; When resolving this use: the unit's Hit rolls succeed only on an unmodified 4+.
The unit's Fire Overwatch ability has no limit on its number of uses, and this use does not count toward that ability's limit for other units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
