          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the target is an enemy unit with the FORTIFICATION, MONSTER or VEHICLE keyword:
  -&gt; Improve this model's Strength characteristic by 2.
  -&gt; Improve this model's Armour Penetration characteristic by 2.
  -&gt; Improve this model's Damage characteristic by 2.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Signum Array" id="8e8c-9d60-f73c-07d6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: During the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit visible to this model if the selected unit is within 18" of the unit: that unit cannot benefit from Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
