          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deployment Complete" id="ee9d-a135-a1b2-9c26" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Friendly units cannot embark into this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Drop Pod Assault" id="3398-938c-8cf1-77d7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit must be placed into Strategic Reserves.
During the first battle round, during the Movement phase, in your turn, the unit can make an Ingress move.
-&gt; When the unit is set up:
  -&gt; Friendly units embarked within the unit must disembark using the Assault Disembarkation rules.
  -&gt; The triggering unit must be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="5ee3-a46c-9bd7-28a7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="e3b6-1c64-6bce-8c25" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
