          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Assault Ramp" id="3cf8-a455-d097-020b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends a Normal move, during the Movement phase, in your turn, friendly units embarked within the unit can disembark using the Assault Disembarkation rules.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="00e1-929d-1bd6-07ec" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="93ca-bf2e-cf07-34e9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Power Of The Machine Spirit" id="2b22-fb30-dfef-0761" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After an enemy unit shoots, until the end of the phase, the unit is eligible to shoot as if it were your Shooting phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
