          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If the unit charged this turn:
  -&gt; The unit gets +1 to Hit rolls with Thunder Hammer weapons.
  -&gt; Thunder Hammer weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
  -&gt; Improve the Damage characteristic of melee weapons other than "Thunder Hammer" equipped by models in this unit by 1.
