            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit ends a move, during the Movement phase, in the opponent's turn, while the triggering unit is within 8" of the unit, while the unit is unengaged, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; The unit can make a Normal move.
  -&gt; The unit can move up to 6", during its Normal moves.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Honour or Death" id="34d3-a1fa-d43c-0df0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When you target the unit with the Heroic Intervention Stratagem, reduce the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1CP (to a minimum of 0CP).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Captain of the Honour Guard" id="16d8-0a91-bb82-3eff" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If your army includes a MARNEUS CALGAR unit:
  -&gt; The unit loses the Leader ability.
  -&gt; The unit gains the Support ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="632c-7c7c-d908-2e30" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
