      <profiles>
        <profile name="Haywire Mine" id="ff8b-42c4-46ea-738d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: During the Shooting phase, in your turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit visible to this model if the selected unit is within 6" of the unit:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 2+, unless the selected unit has the VEHICLE keyword, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; if the selected unit has the VEHICLE keyword, that unit suffers 2D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="ec20-6c09-b888-f219" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Divinator-class Auspexes (Once per phase, per unit)" id="6517-4a20-6203-7183" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a friendly unit is selected to shoot (the triggering unit must have ADEPTUS ASTARTES), you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit within 18" of the unit visible to this model:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as auspex scanned.
    -&gt; While the target is tagged auspex scanned, while making ranged attacks, if the target unit is the same unit as the selected unit, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Combat Doctrines" id="4df8-671d-40c8-9c2a" hidden="false" targetId="b872-9bc1-1978-41ae" type="rule"/>
