            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth" id="fdd9-26a4-34e2-b791" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Stealth ability, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Infiltrators" id="45cc-b9fa-c1c1-4a75" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Infiltrators ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="925d-ba58-2340-c5d8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="1ebd-3007-6cc0-1545" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Strategic Acumen" id="2f68-f645-f3fc-096e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: During the Command phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Command phase, select one option of Combat Doctrines for the unit, in place of any already active.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tactical Fluidity (Once per battle round, per unit)" id="ff9f-42fb-ddc9-cbfb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; After the unit resolves its attacks: during the Shooting phase, in your turn, while the unit is unengaged, the unit can make a Normal move of up to D6".
-&gt; At the end of your opponent's Fight phase: while the unit is engaged, the unit can Fall Back up to 6".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
