        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="ee1d-18cb-2c0e-4ca8" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="3"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Astraeus" id="71f5-6420-e822-ca67" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">24</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">Hull</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="2045-f96b-8727-d5a7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="9d63-072b-3f98-939e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Suppression Fire" id="4702-648d-6db3-8265" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by Twin Macro-accelerator Cannon during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as suppressed.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged suppressed, that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Combat Doctrines" id="04d5-7f8c-2ea1-9746" hidden="false" targetId="b872-9bc1-1978-41ae" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
