        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="cc42-6fc0-bcb8-2d5c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="f8ad-4240-6abf-3b37" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Veiling Smoke (Once per phase, per unit)" id="cc0c-7526-2197-4da9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: The unit is eligible to be targeted with the Smokescreen Stratagem even if it has already been targeted with that Stratagem this phase.
Reduce the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1CP (to a minimum of 0CP).
The unit's Smokescreen ability has no limit on its number of uses, and this use does not count toward that ability's limit for other units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
