      <profiles>
        <profile name="Fearsome Assault" id="4e1b-2139-ce99-c3df" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, once per phase per army:
  For each enemy unit: While the unit is within Engagement Range of a friendly unit with the Fearsome Assault ability, the unit must take a Battle-shock test, applying -1 to that test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Terror Troops (Aura)" id="02ff-48a5-3fdf-6709" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While an enemy model is within 3" of the unit, worsen that model's Objective Control characteristic by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="ebc7-4db8-5056-424b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Grapnel Launchers" id="21ba-8eee-34a2-ee1b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit is selected to make a Normal, Advance, Fall Back, Charge, Pile-in, Consolidation, Surge or Scout move, you may use this ability:
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over models as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over models as though they were not there; the triggering unit ignores vertical distances when it moves.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
