          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is attached to a BLOOD CLAWS unit:
  -&gt; Improve the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in this unit by 1.
  -&gt; Melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
  -&gt; When the unit is selected to make an Advance move: while this model is attached to a HEADTAKERS WOLF GUARD unit, the unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Advanced this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
