      <profiles>
        <profile name="Njal Stormcaller" id="0fa4-d188-de2f-252e" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">7"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">40mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="eacf-a0f1-b23d-96b9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tempest's Wrath (Psychic)" id="acc4-bf19-1510-1620" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: During the Shooting phase, in your turn, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Roll D6, then:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
      - On 1: The unit is Battle-shocked.
      - On 2-6: Nothing happens.
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit visible to this model if the selected unit is within 18" of the unit:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as suppressed.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged suppressed, that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Wind Walker (Psychic)" id="d093-f58a-baee-e567" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT].
-&gt; When the unit is selected to make an Advance move, you may use this ability: the unit's Advance rolls count as 6.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="High Rune Priest (psyker level 3)" id="574a-63d7-56a2-a05a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Set this model's Psyker Level characteristic to 3.
-&gt; You can:
  -&gt; By paying this cost (spend 1 Psychic Level), until the end of the phase: during the Movement phase, in your turn, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, roll D6; then roll one D6: on 1, the unit is Battle-shocked; on 2-6, nothing happens; select one enemy unit visible to this model if the selected unit is within 12" of the unit: that unit cannot shoot using the Snap Shooting rules.
-&gt; When an enemy unit targets this unit, you may use this ability, by paying this cost (spend 1 Psychic Level), until the end of the phase: while the unit is not Battle-shocked, roll D6; then roll one D6: on 1, the unit is Battle-shocked; on 2-6, nothing happens; subtract 3 from the unit's detection range characteristic.
-&gt; You can:
  -&gt; By paying this cost (spend 1 Psychic Level), until the start of your next turn: during the Shooting phase, in your turn, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, roll D6; then roll one D6: on 1, the unit is Battle-shocked; on 2-6, nothing happens; select one enemy unit visible to this model if the selected unit is within 18" of the unit: that unit is marked as suppressed; while the selected unit is tagged suppressed, that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
