        <profile name="Savage Frenzy" id="a5d9-e6e0-3f87-9f36" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit starts a Fall Back move, while the triggering unit is within Engagement Range of the unit, unless the triggering unit has the MONSTER keyword, unless the triggering unit has the VEHICLE keyword:
  -&gt; While the triggering unit is Battle-shocked, the triggering unit must take a Desperate Escape test, applying -1 to that test.
  -&gt; While the triggering unit is not Battle-shocked, the triggering unit must take a Desperate Escape test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
