          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Bestial Fury" id="1ebe-0f23-cc2e-6ba0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can re-roll the Advance roll.
You can re-roll the Charge roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Force of Untamed Destruction" id="01bb-f08e-1da9-21f4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit cannot be your Warlord.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Murder-maker" id="23d9-bcc1-a70f-14b8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a friendly WULFEN model is destroyed, until the end of the phase, during the Fight phase, while that model is within 6" of the unit, unless that model has fought this phase, roll one D6. On a 4+, leave that model on the battlefield; when its unit is selected to fight, it can fight. Remove it after this unit has fought or at the end of the phase, whichever comes first.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="32dc-91af-ad82-d148" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="573c-39e7-472d-22db" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
