          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; At the end of your Movement phase: while the unit is within range of an objective marker you control, objective markers the unit controls remain under your control until your opponent's Level of Control over them is greater than yours at the end of a phase.
-&gt; When the unit is selected to fight, you may use this ability, once per battle per army, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in this unit.
  -&gt; Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
