              <rules>
                <rule name="Mission Tactics" id="604a-623e-ef66-9c6a" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly KILL TEAM units with the Mission Tactics Deathwatch Support ability gain the Furor Tactics ability:
  -&gt; While the Devastator Doctrine option of Combat Doctrines is active, the unit's weapons gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
All friendly KILL TEAM units with the Mission Tactics Deathwatch Support ability gain the Malleus Tactics ability:
  -&gt; While the Tactical Doctrine option of Combat Doctrines is active, the unit's weapons gain [LETHAL HITS].
All friendly KILL TEAM units with the Mission Tactics Deathwatch Support ability gain the Purgatus Tactics ability:
  -&gt; While the Assault Doctrine option of Combat Doctrines is active, while the target unit is an enemy unit, while the target is within 9" of the unit, the unit's weapons gain [PRECISION].
Your army can include at most 500 points of DEATHWATCH units.
All friendly DEATHWATCH units cannot be your Warlord.
All friendly KILL TEAM units can only be given Enhancements from this Detachment.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
