              <rules>
                <rule name="Combined Deployment" id="d312-7119-6b6e-61bc" hidden="false">
                  <description>After a friendly unit shoots (the triggering unit must have ADEPTUS ASTARTES and TRANSPORT), you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as assailed.
    -&gt; While the target is tagged assailed, if the attacking unit disembarked from a Transport this turn, all friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units' weapons gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
