                  <description>-&gt; At the start of the battle round, you may use this ability, for the rest of the battle: during the first battle round, select one (each may be chosen once per battle): Abhor the Witch, Destroy the Witch (while making melee attacks, while the attacking unit is a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit against PSYKER targets, melee weapons equipped by all friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units gain [PRECISION]; melee weapons equipped by all friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units gain [LANCE]) / Accept Any Challenge, No Matter the Odds (while making melee attacks, while the attacking unit is a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit, when the target's T is more than the attack's S, all friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units get +1 to Wound rolls) / Uphold the Honour of the Emperor (all friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY units gain the following rules (at the end of your Movement phase: while the unit is within range of an objective marker you control, objective markers the unit controls remain under your control until your opponent's Level of Control over them is greater than yours at the end of a phase; when the unit is selected to make an Advance move: the unit is eligible to start an Action even if it Advanced this turn)).
Your army can include BLACK TEMPLARS units.
Your army can include units from only one Chapter.</description>
