                  <description>Increase the number of uses of the unit's Devastator Doctrine (Combat Doctrines) ability by 1.
While the target is within 12" of the unit, improve the Strength characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by all friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units by 1.
