              <constraints>
                <constraint id="3d27-c810-0d2a-4bcc" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Storm-swift Onslaught" id="cb0a-8cec-6f96-08af" hidden="false">
                  <description>You can select Assault Doctrine or Tactical Doctrine one additional time per battle, shared between them.
All friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units with the MOUNTED or SPEEDER keyword get +1 to Advance rolls.
All friendly SUBODEN KHAN units gain the Wrath of the First Khan ability:
  -&gt; At the end of the Fight phase, you may use this ability: if the unit is eligible to fight, select one of the following: while the unit is unengaged, the unit can make a Normal move / while the unit is engaged, the unit can Fall Back.
Your army can include WHITE SCARS units.
Your army can include units from only one Chapter.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="9f7b-724f-0387-87ae" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
