              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of each phase, if this model was destroyed this phase (1+ times), once per battle per army:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 2+, this model can be set up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed more than 1" away from all enemy models, with 3 wounds remaining.
