              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Once per battle per army, during the Command phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Command phase:
  -&gt; The unit gains Assault Doctrine (Combat Doctrines).
  -&gt; The unit gains Devastator Doctrine (Combat Doctrines).
