              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Unless the Assault Doctrine option of Combat Doctrines is active:
  -&gt; Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model.
  -&gt; Add 1 to the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model.
While the Assault Doctrine option of Combat Doctrines is active:
  -&gt; Add 2 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model.
  -&gt; Add 2 to the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model.</characteristic>
