      <description>At the start of the battle round, while this model has the Transhuman Strategist ability, while this model is the Warlord, you gain 1CP.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Heirs of Sigismund" id="153e-dd76-e2d8-354c" hidden="false">
      <description>Your army cannot include Adeptus Astartes Psyker units.
Your army cannot include Gladiator Lancer, Gladiator Reaper, Gladiator Valiant, Impulsor, Repulsor or Repulsor Executioner units.</description>
    </rule>
