    <rule name="Curse of the Wulfen" id="c6dd-3e5b-f82a-2cec" hidden="false">
      <description>While the unit is within 6" of a friendly CHARACTER SPACE WOLVES model (excluding WULFEN models) or while the unit is within 12" of a friendly WOLF PRIEST model, while the unit is not Battle-shocked:
  -&gt; If the unit has the INFANTRY keyword, add 1 to the unit's Objective Control characteristic.
  -&gt; If the unit has the VEHICLE keyword, add 3 to the unit's Objective Control characteristic.
For Transport capacity, each Wulfen model occupies 2 model spaces.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Transhuman Strategist" id="5b06-9927-7889-6dd0" hidden="false">
